  "details": "With all these new bits to play around with, our Expression Parameter lists are going to increase in size.\nPlease consider making the VRCExpressionParameters GUI a bit easier to work with.\nPotential Ideas-\nUp/Down buttons replaced by dragging parameters on the left side like Unity's default reorderablelist GUI.\nAdd/Delete placed to the right of the Saved checkbox, or as a right click context menu. Original buttons could probably stay.\nMulti-select for moving, copying, and deleting groups of parameters at a time. CTRL-C/X/V & Delete button support for QOL.",
